Returned or Failed Transfers: You are liable for penalties, interest, or fees from failed EFT transactions, including a $75 returned payment fee. 

Gross Revenue: "Gross Revenue" is the total amount from all sales of Approved Products and Services, including those made directly or indirectly by you or affiliates, regardless of payment method or collection status. It includes: 
(i) sales through your WIN Business; 
(ii) sales by you or any Principal Owner, or by anyone acting on your behalf; 
(iii) sales under any DBA name; 
(iv) sales by your WIN Business, with or without Marks; 
(v) revenue from Approved Products and Services marketed through WIN-approved platforms. 

Exclusions from Gross Revenue: (a) bona fide gratuities; (b) sales tax collected; (c) customer refunds; (d) payment processor fees unless specified. 

